African American.
Billionaire, he's amazing.

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:00.290
And a genius.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.330
Harry. He showed me how to be expressive,

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.163
how to treat others.

00:10:03.163 --> 00:10:03.996
And then Billie,

00:10:03.996 --> 00:10:05.560
she just showed me what you
can achieve at a young age

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:06.507
and what's possible and whatnot so.

00:10:06.507 --> 00:10:07.610
- You're so right.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:08.700
- Treat people with kindness.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.590
- Wait, why are you here again? Sorry.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:12.510
- I'm here because I make music.

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:13.830
I just wanna get to know people.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:15.350
I connect with people here.

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:16.650
- So if we let you win,

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.880
you'll take us backstage when you perform.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.213
- Definitely I will.

00:10:20.213 --> 00:10:21.239
- (all laughing)

00:10:21.239 --> 00:10:23.630
- Sounds good, sounds good.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:25.050
- Okay. Time's up.

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:27.680
Here is the final voting rule.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:29.080
Players can move one brick

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.220
from any stack to another.

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:34.699
Only players who currently have
stacks are allowed to vote.

00:10:34.699 --> 00:10:37.949
(intense string music)

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:55.433
- He has a couple bricks to lose.

00:11:09.283 --> 00:11:10.820
- He's never been to a concert.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.123
He deserved at least one.

00:11:18.382 --> 00:11:19.830
- I gave him one the first round

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:21.247
So now I'm gonna be
selfish and give it to me.

00:11:21.247 --> 00:11:22.093
I'm so sorry.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.260
- It was a very close game.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.103
Y'all ready?

00:11:30.103 --> 00:11:30.950
- No.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:34.611
- Open your eyes in three, two, one.

00:11:34.611 --> 00:11:35.935
(all applauding)

00:11:35.935 --> 00:11:39.102
(cash register noise)

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:43.230
- Congratulations.

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:45.200
Here are your Coachella tickets.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.949
- Thank you so much.

00:11:46.949 --> 00:11:49.150
(all applauding)

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:51.480
- I absolutely didn't expect it.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.360
The moment I won, I was so happy

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:56.730
But somehow, I feel a bit bad
for the other people as well.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.800
No matter what stories you have.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:01.163
I think everybody deserved
it the same amount.

00:12:02.749 --> 00:12:05.582
(exciting music)

00:12:13.065 --> 00:12:15.648
(all laughing)

